Package: smbr
Type: Package
Title: Tidy SMB File Access
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("smbr", "Contributors", email = "smbr@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: smbr Contributors
Maintainer: smbr Contributors <smbr@example.org>
Description: A focused, R-native interface to SMB/CIFS file shares through
    the pure-Rust smb2 client library. Provides tidyverse-friendly directory
    listings and simple file transfer verbs without Python or Samba.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    Rcpp,
    tibble
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
SystemRequirements: Rust toolchain with Cargo for source builds without a
    precompiled backend (rustc 1.85 or newer)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    dplyr,
    readr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
